  "metaDescription": "Nollywood icon Pete Edochie has died at age 79. Tributes pour in from across Nigeria as his family reveals the actor had been battling prostate cancer.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Actor Pete Edochie passed away at age 79 following a six-year battle with prostate cancer, according to his family.",
